#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_par
msgid ""
". With this amount QTY_PRODUCT  children can be cared for and sustainably "
"supported for MONTHS in the program of Compassion. In addition, the children"
" are supported by young people from Switzerland through prayer and letters."
msgstr ""
". Con questo importo QTY_PRODUCT bambini possono essere curati e sostenuti "
"in modo sostenibile per MONTHS nel programma di Compassion. Inoltre, i "
"bambini sono sostenuti dai giovani svizzeri attraverso la preghiera e le "
"lettere."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,crowdfunding_description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_toilets
#: model:product.template,description_sale:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_toilets
msgid ""
"38% of the world population does not have daily access to a decent toilet. "
"Compassion is committed to building and sanitizing toilets for children."
msgstr ""
"il 38% della popolazione mondiale non ha accesso giornaliero a servizi "
"igienici dignitosi. Compassion si impegna a costruire e risanare i servizi "
"igienici per i bambini."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_nol
msgid ""
"<br>                Thanks to the Christmas Gift Fund, we can offer a "
"Christmas gift to each<br>                child registered in a Compassion "
"center. It prevents inequalities<br>                between the children at "
"least at this special time of the year. We are<br>                very "
"grateful for your donation by which you share the joy of Christmas<br>"
"                with each child of Compassion.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_wtp
msgid ""
"<br>                Thanks to your donation. It allows us to finance water "
"disinfection<br>                project to provide sponsored children, their"
" families, their community<br>                and villages with drinking "
"water, in the poorest regions of the world.<br>                This help "
"would not be possible without you and we are very grateful for<br>"
"                your support.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_csp
msgid ""
"<br>                The CSP Fund  (Child Survival Program) allows us to "
"support 3 CSP<br>                centers, two in Haiti and one in Ecuador. "
"Each CSP center welcomes<br>                around 30 mothers and their "
"babies and pregnant women. These women<br>                receive training, "
"practical assistance, food, thorough medical checks on<br>                a "
"regular basis and Bible lessons."
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_usp
msgid ""
"<br>                Your donation to the \"Unsponsored Children Fund\" "
"unlocks the benefits<br>                of Compassion's program for children"
" who have been registered but not<br>                yet been sponsored. "
"Your gift to this fund also encourages parents and<br>                "
"program staff as they see Compassion benefits at work for the children<br>"
"                they love, even as they wait — and hope — for sponsors."
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_ovc
msgid ""
"<br>            Compassion's Highly Vulnerable Children's Fund provides "
"food,<br>            clothing and a nurturing Christian home environment to "
"children in poverty who are orphans<br>            or who have no adult "
"caretakers.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_mds
msgid ""
"<br>            On behalf of of Raymond Girardet, we thank you for your "
"donation<br>            which will allow him to realize his project.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_aid
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to the AIDS fund we can bring the necessary lifelong "
"care to<br>            the HIV-infected sponsored children (antiretroviral "
"therapy).<br>            We are very grateful to you for your support to "
"this fund and<br>            for the great hope you offer to the sick "
"children and their families.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_ldp
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to the LDP Fund, we currently support 3 LDP students,"
" Alfredo and<br>            Hellen from Ecuador and Tamirat from Ethiopia. "
"The Leadership Development Program allows gifted young<br>            "
"Christian people who have arrived at the end of their sponsorship to go to "
"University and be trained<br>            as Christian leaders. In the coming"
" years, these young people will be able to positively influence<br>"
"            their nation for God.<br>            Through your donation you "
"are offering these students a chance for a promising future and we are "
"very<br>            grateful to you for your support.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_haf
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to water filters and rehydratation kits, the families"
" of<br>            sponsored children can face this severe epidemic "
"efficiently.<br>            We are very grateful to you for your "
"contribution to this action and for the help you<br>            therefore "
"give the children and their families.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_don
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation to Compassion Suisse we can continue"
" to make our<br>            work known in Switzerland and to improve our "
"services to sponsors, donors and sponsored children.<br>            We can "
"offer a more efficient help to many needy children through sponsorships and "
"complementary<br>            interventions in the countries supported by "
"Compassion.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_anl
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation to Compassion Suisse we can continue"
" to make<br>            our work known in Switzerland and to improve our "
"services to sponsors, donors and sponsorchildren.<br>            We can "
"offer a more efficient help to many needy children through sponsorships and "
"complementary<br>            interventions in the countries supported by "
"Compassion.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_urg
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation to the humanitarian emergency "
"fund,<br>            you make it possible for the Compassion staff to bring "
"the needed help immediately to<br>            the families of sponsored "
"children who are touched by a natural disaster, famine or<br>            any"
" other tragedy.<br>            Food, covers, shelters and replacement of "
"certains belongings are commonly covered by this fund."
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_med
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation to the medical fund we can offer "
"each<br>            sponsored child affected by a serious illness the "
"necessary medical care and that way<br>            restore both health and "
"hope. Apart from this we can also finance complementary interventions<br>"
"            such as a vaccination campaign for several Compassion centers, "
"distribution of mosquito nets<br>            to families that are registered"
" in the Compassion program.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_mag
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation you have subscribed to our magazine "
"and you<br>            help us to cover the publishing costs. Our magazine "
"is an important communication tool and<br>            allows us to make our "
"work known and to sensibilise many people to the cause of poor children.<br>"
"            We are very grateful for your precious support.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_bib
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation you support the Bible Fund, by which"
" we can<br>            offer a Bible to each child registered in a "
"Compassion center. The holistic development of the<br>            child is "
"one of the principal values of Compassion.<br>            Your support helps"
" the child to grow spiritually, to strengthen his faith and to receive a<br>"
"            precious encouragement.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_ind
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation, the families touched by the recent "
"cyclone Aila in<br>            India and Bangladesh can receive a precious "
"help. Compassion has already started to bring support and<br>            "
"food to the affected families and will start to work at the rebuilding of "
"damaged or destroyed centers<br>            or houses as soon as "
"possible.<br>            Your support is essential and brings new hope to "
"the families of sponsored children, the staff of<br>            Compassion "
"and the partner churches.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_hai
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation, the families touched by the "
"terrible earthquake in<br>            Haiti can receive a precious help. "
"Compassion is currently bringing support and food to the affected<br>"
"            families and giving them all the necessary support. The "
"emergency fund will also enable Compassion to<br>            rebuild damaged"
" or destroyed centers by the disaster.<br>            Your support is "
"essential and represents a clear sign of hope to the sponsored children, "
"their<br>            families, the staff of Compassion and the partner "
"churches in Haiti.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_phi
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation, the families touched by the typhoon"
" in<br>            the Philippines can receive a precious help. Compassion "
"Philippines continues to distribute<br>            food as well as first aid"
" material and bring the necessary support to all who have been affected<br>"
"            by the floods."
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_fam
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation, the sponsored children and their "
"families touched<br>            by famine receive a precious help. "
"Compassion distributes food to the affected families but also<br>"
"            provides formation and tools that help families to combat hunger"
" on a long term basis.<br>            We thank you so much for your "
"generosity and for your interest towards the poorest children and their<br>"
"            families and for the hope that you give them through your "
"support.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_bfa
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation, the sponsored children and their "
"families<br>            touched by the recent floods in Burkina Faso can "
"receive a precious help. Compassion Burkina<br>            Faso has already "
"started to bring support and food to the affected families and will start "
"to<br>            work at the rebuilding of damaged or destroyed centers or "
"houses as soon as possible.<br>            Your support is essential and is "
"a real sign of hope for the sponsored children, their families,<br>"
"            the staff of Compassion and the partner churches.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_cal
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation, you help us to finance our calendar"
" which<br>            is a precious communication tool to make our work "
"known in many households during the year.<br>            We also can offer a"
" concrete help and a new future to many children on the field and "
"restore<br>            hope in their lives."
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_wol
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your donation. It allows us to finance water "
"filters<br>            to provide sponsored children, their families, their "
"community and villages with drinking<br>            water, in the poorest "
"regions of the world.<br>            This help would not be possible without"
" you and we are very grateful for your support.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_kdo
msgid ""
"<br>            Thanks to your gift that will be entirely allocated to them,"
" the family of<br>            your sponsored child will receive a precious "
"additional help to cover their special needs and to<br>            improve "
"their living conditions.<br>            We are very grateful for your "
"complementary support to your sponsored child and his family that<br>"
"            brings more hope and great encouragement to them.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_pro
msgid ""
"<br>            The professional fund allows many young sponsored people to "
"receive<br>            a professional training before they finish the "
"sponsorship program.<br>            Thanks to your support we can continue "
"to offer this service on a long-term basis and we are<br>            very "
"grateful to you for your help.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_c20
msgid ""
"<br>            With your donation, you support the CSP (child survival "
"program) in<br>            Ecuador. The center welcomes around 30 mothers "
"and their babies and pregnant women. These women<br>            receive "
"training, practical assistance, food, thorough medical checks on a regular "
"basis and Bible lessons."
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_c13
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_c46
msgid ""
"<br>            With your donation, you support the CSP (child survival "
"program) in<br>            Haiti. The center welcomes around 30 mothers and "
"their babies and pregnant women. These women<br>            receive "
"training, practical assistance, food, thorough medical checks on a regular "
"basis and Bible lessons."
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model_terms:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_kgs
msgid ""
"<br>            Your support helps the organizer of the Kids Games to plan "
"this event<br>            for the first time in Burkina Faso. Your support "
"also helps many of the children in the sponsorship<br>            program to"
" take part of this event.<br>"
msgstr ""

